+V64.3.50 EAF-ICER-PIOR ENGINEERING VALIDATION
+
+Scientific status
+-----------------
+NOT RUN / NOT CLAIMED in this local environment.  V50 requires the server-side nuPlan TRAIN cache, raw TRAIN DBs, historical roots, and checkpoint to collect the preregistered paired closed-loop selected-outcome evidence.  The launcher is fail-closed: if data/probe identity, paired-outcome identification, or the paired retention gate fails, it stops before any untouched validation.
+
+V49 prerequisite audit
+----------------------
+PASS  Uploaded V49 code ZIP SHA256 matches the preregistered V49 package: 4bc0044ffb311eaf3db77d221bad58ca8d5de21f6987c337ea098874811d112b.
+PASS  V49 current source manifest independently checked: 907/907 files, zero mismatch.
+PASS  Server targeted regression: 242/242.
+PASS  Independent local V49 targeted replay: 242/242.
+PASS  V49 stopped at nested TRAIN identification/deployment gate before selecting or consuming new fresh A/B.
+PASS  V49 preregistered branch therefore closes the current offline selected-risk family and requires an outcome-source change.
+
+V50 implementation contract
+---------------------------
+PASS  Full-set RSMR remains the sole proposal selector; tournament.py is unchanged.
+PASS  Frozen tournament.py SHA256: 291b3b77202974b74fe42431ee7954de8c401d927591c19a12a5837f18374044.
+PASS  PIOR probe is TRAIN-only and can fire at most once per scenario.
+PASS  Treatment executes exactly the already-frozen full-set RSMR proposal at the first proposal event; control executes incumbent.
+PASS  After the paired intervention event, both arms return to incumbent-only execution for the remainder of the scenario.
